  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 11 November 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nTucked in a popular, flat location just a leisurely 4-minute walk from Orewa Beach, this single-level brick and tile home offers a blend of comfort, solid durability, and low-maintenance ease.\r\n\r\nDesigned with practicality and relaxed living in mind, the open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area forms the heart of the home. Wide hallways, oversized doors, and a walk-in shower enhance the sense of space and effortless accessibility throughout. Step outside from the main living area onto a sunny patio—the perfect sunny nook for morning coffees, afternoon reads, or casual catch-ups.\r\n\r\n• Semi-ensuite bathroom, plus a separate guest W.C.\r\n\r\n• Double glazing and solar water heating..\r\n\r\n• Flat stroll to shops, cafes, and services.\r\n\r\nAn easier pace of life, by the beach.",
